ongman).<\/p>\n<p>K dispozici v\u00e1m budou \u010desko-anglick\u00e9 slovn\u00edky a\u00a0dal\u0161\u00ed materi\u00e1ly. Ve v\u00fduce pou\u017e\u00edv\u00e1me spousty dopl\u0148kov\u00fdch aktivit a\u00a0\u0159adu u\u017eite\u010dn\u00fdch materi\u00e1l\u016f tak\u00e9 dostanete zdarma.[\/vc_column_text][\/vc_column][vc_column width=&#8220;1\/2&#8243;]<div id=\"ultimate-heading-54566a0da955c40f4\" class=\"uvc-heading ult-adjust-bottom-margin ultimate-heading-54566a0da955c40f4 uvc-7323 \" data-hspacer=\"line_only\"  data-halign=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left\"><div class=\"uvc-main-heading ult-responsive\"  data-ultimate-target='.uvc-heading.ultimate-heading-54566a0da955c40f4 h3'  data-responsive-json-new='{\"font-size\":\"\",\"line-height\":\"\"}' ><h3 style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Platebn\u00ed podm\u00ednky<\/h3><\/div><div class=\"uvc-heading-spacer line_only\" style=\"margin-bottom:1.5em;height:1px;\"><span class=\"uvc-headings-line\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1px;border-color:#af1b1d;width:autopx;\"><\/span><\/div><\/div>[vc_column_text]<\/p>\n<div class=\"excerpt\">\n<p>Po vz\u00e1jemn\u00e9 dohod\u011b v\u00e1m na uvedenou e-mailovou adresu po\u0161lu <strong>fakturu<\/strong>, kterou je t\u0159eba uhradit na n\u00ed\u017ee uveden\u00fd bankovn\u00ed \u00fa\u010det. Va\u0161e m\u00edsto v\u00a0kurzu je takto pevn\u011b rezervov\u00e1no.<\/p>\n<p>Kurzy se plat\u00ed bankovn\u00edm p\u0159evodem na \u00fa\u010det (Air Bank):<\/p>\n<p><strong>1626570018\/3030<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Pros\u00edm pou\u017eijte variabiln\u00ed symbol uveden\u00fd ve faktu\u0159e.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Do zpr\u00e1vy pro p\u0159\u00edjemce uve\u010fte pros\u00edm svoje jm\u00e9no, p\u0159\u00edjmen\u00ed a\u00a0n\u00e1zev kurzu. V\u00a0p\u0159\u00edpad\u011b, \u017ee nastoup\u00edte do kurzu pozd\u011bji, zaplat\u00edte samoz\u0159ejm\u011b jen zb\u00fdvaj\u00edc\u00ed lekce.<\/p>\n<p>Pokud jste kurz nestihli nap\u0159\u00edklad kv\u016fli nemoci nebo zahrani\u010dn\u00ed cest\u011b, nen\u00ed probl\u00e9m se domluvit na n\u00e1hrad\u011b v\u00a0jin\u00e9 skupin\u011b stejn\u00e9 \u00farovn\u011b.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text][\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row padding_bottom_multiplier=&#8220;&#8220;][vc_column]<div id=\"ultimate-heading-95376a0da955c4116\" class=\"uvc-heading ult-adjust-bottom-margin ultimate-heading-95376a0da955c4116 uvc-2260 \" data-hspacer=\"line_only\"  data-halign=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left\"><div class=\"uvc-main-heading ult-responsive\"  data-ultimate-target='.uvc-heading.ultimate-heading-95376a0da955c4116 h2'  data-responsive-json-new='{\"font-size\":\"\",\"line-height\":\"\"}' ><h2 style=\"font-weight:normal;\">P\u0159ihl\u00e1\u0161ka ke kurz\u016fm<\/h2><\/div><div class=\"uvc-heading-spacer line_only\" style=\"margin-bottom:1.5em;height:1px;\"><span class=\"uvc-headings-line\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1px;border-color:#af1b1d;width:autopx;\"><\/span><\/div><\/div>[\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row padding_top_multiplier=&#8220;&#8220; padding_bottom_multiplier=&#8220;&#8220;][vc_column width=&#8220;2\/3&#8243;][vc_column_text css=&#8220;.vc_custom_1632061397424{margin-bottom: 2em !important;}&#8220;]Je to jednoduch\u00e9. <strong>Zavol\u00e1me si<\/strong>, popov\u00edd\u00e1me si o\u00a0va\u0161\u00ed p\u0159edstav\u011b, o\u00a0tom, jak to u\u00a0n\u00e1s prob\u00edh\u00e1 a\u00a0t\u0159eba i\u00a0o\u00a0tom, jak\u00fd druh \u010daje m\u00e1te r\u00e1di \ud83d\ude42 Pak v\u00e1m navrhnu kurz, kter\u00fd by v\u00e1m nejl\u00e9pe vyhovoval a\u00a0probereme i\u00a0\u010dasov\u00e9 mo\u017enosti.[\/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=&#8220;.vc_custom_1756412654365{padding-top: 1.3em !important;padding-right: 1.3em !important;padding-bottom: 1.3em !important;padding-left: 1.3em !important;background-color: #f4efea !important;border-radius: 5px !important;}&#8220;]<\/p>\n<div class=\"caldera-grid\" id=\"caldera_form_1\" data-cf-ver=\"1.9.7\" data-cf-form-id=\"CF68b0b3